[Orders]:
Load * From [lib://Files/orders_2025.qvd] (qvd);

Concatenate (Orders)
Load * From [lib://Files/orders_2026.qvd] (qvd);

Left Join ([Orders])
Load
    CustomerId,
    CustomerName
From [lib://Files/customers.qvd] (qvd);

Inner Keep(Orders) Load * From [lib://Files/regions.qvd] (qvd);

[Archive]:
NoConcatenate
Load * Resident [Orders];

SQL SELECT * FROM a JOIN b ON a.id = b.id;
